 ## 5. Verification
 
-TESTS
+- **My tests** (`node --test test/bigtech-*.test.js test/amazon-meta-*.test.js`): 54/54 on 3cf226e.
+  - `amazon-meta-resume` (4): the paused half and the resumed half of 3.2 (25 s, builds two sites).
